395600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"maBve"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7273d5c3-2d9c-4f3a-9354-299eb3250439","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何やってんの？は分かるけど何でやってんの？は分からん感じ","ts":"1618975348.395500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fdg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d03ad3fb-9c68-456c-9665-9c1ce266d7dc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"vimrc","ts":"1618975335.395400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b028df6-fcc2-43d2-906c-a102b333dec2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"下手なドキュメント用意されるくらいなら読んだ方が早いくらいには思ってるけどお気持ち汲み取るのは無理だな","ts":"1618975214.395200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J5meI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7036a98-c538-47fc-8e72-1ededeb8f3a1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"筆者の気持ち","ts":"1618975140.395100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0479401-3b0a-4b80-b522-e62ce2698f68","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分コード読むの苦手なんですよね","ts":"1618975137.394800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f287176c-27cb-46bc-940d-238760ceb548","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コード読むの好きだし(理解できてるとは言っていない)こんな方向目指すのもありかも \u003chttps://blog.riywo.com/2021/04/software-engineer-who-reads-code/|https://blog.riywo.com/2021/04/software-engineer-who-reads-code/\u003e","ts":"1618974953.394500","attachments":[{"fallback":"コードが読めるソフトウェア開発者","id":1,"title":"コードが読めるソフトウェア開発者","title_link":"https://blog.riywo.com/2021/04/software-engineer-who-reads-code/","text":"僕はコードを読むのは得意な方だけど、それが過ぎてコードを書かなくてもシニアソフトウェア開発者になってしまった。実はコードをちゃんと読めるソフトウェア開発者って希少価値が高いのではないか、と思ったので自分がどんな感じでシニアになったのかをまとめてみた。似た様な人の参考になれば幸いだ。","image_url":"https://blog.riywo.com/og-images/440ab57d-3943-5d33-9bb9-ea243edada66.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"blog.riywo.com","service_icon":"https://blog.riywo.com/icons/icon-48x48.png?v=72438b38f545fac8ca9133502d178901","from_url":"https://blog.riywo.com/2021/04/software-engineer-who-reads-code/","original_url":"https://blog.riywo.com/2021/04/software-engineer-who-reads-code/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qeS"}]}]
